# Endpoint do formulario de contato (Formspree)
# 1. Crie uma conta gratuita em https://formspree.io
# 2. Crie um novo formulario e copie o endpoint (ex: https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx)
# 3. Na Vercel: Project Settings > Environment Variables > adicione NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=
